Upstream files that name additional copyright holders:

    src/ShellCheck/Fixer.hs            Copyright 2018-2019 Vidar Holen, Ng Zhi An
    src/ShellCheck/Formatter/Quiet.hs  Copyright 2019 Austin Voecks

The port follows upstream commit

    e11f964f6f2cb0009dd259ec33d563c45aa3453d   (v0.11.0-171-ge11f964, 2026-11-05)

